  "_source": "Gloomspite Gitz - Da King's Gitz.cat",
  "End of Any Turn": "",
  "Deployment Phase": "",
  "**^^Hero^^** only": "",
  "Your Movement Phase": "",
  "Once Per Battle, Deployment Phase": "",
  "Once Per Battle (Army), End of Your Turn": "",
  "Pick up to D3 friendly non-**^^Unique King's Gitz Heroes^^** that do not have an enhancement.": "",
  "Roll a D3 for each target, On a 2+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll.": "",
  "Pick a friendly **^^Infantry^^** unit within 3\" of this unit and that is not in combat to be the target.": "",
  "Pick a point on the battlefield within 9\" of this unit. Each visible enemy unit within 3\" of that point is a target.": "",
  "Set up a replacement unit wholly within 12\" of a friendly **Bad Moon Loonshrine** and more than 3\" from all enemy units.": "",
  "This unit has **^^Ward (6+)^^**. While this unit is contesting an objective that is not being coned by any other friendly units, it has **^^Ward (5+)^^**.": "",
  "Give each **^^Hero^^** 1 enhancement ftom the 'Da King's Gitz' Army of Renown rules.\r\n**Designer's Note:** *These enhancements are given to the* **^^Heroes^^** *during the deployment phase, not during army composition.*": "",
  "Roll a D3. Add the roll to the distance the target can move when using **^^Move^^** abilities this phase. If the target ends a move in this phase within 3\" of this **^^Hero^^**, inflict an amount of mortal damage on this **^^Hero^^** equal to the roll.": "",
  "You cannot use this ability and the **Bad Moon Loonshrine's** 'Moonclan Lairs' ability in the same turn. While this unit is within 12\" of a friendly **Bad Moon Loonshrine**, pick a friendly non-reinforced, non-**^^Hero^^**, non-**^^Monster King's Gitz^^** unit that has been destroyed to be the target.": "",
  "While a friendly unit is wholly within 9\" of a friendly **Skragrott**, a friendly **Malevolent Moon** or a friendly **Bad Moon Loonshrine**:\r\n• Add 5 to the control scores of friendly non-**^^Squig Moonclan^^** units.\r\n• Instead of rolling the dice to determine the Move characteristic of a friendly **^^Squig^^** unit, you can use a value of 4.": "",
  "Pick 1 of this unit's non-**Companion** melee weapons. Add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of that weapon for the rest of the battle. In addition, each time this unit uses a **^^Retreat^^** ability, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of that weapon for the rest of the battle. This unit can be affected by this ability multiple times and the effects are cumulative.": "",
  "While a friendly **^^Troggoth^^** unit  is within the combat range of a friendly **^^Hero^^**:\r\n• That friendly **^^Hero^^** has **^^Ward (4+)^^**.\r\n• Each time you make a successful ward roll for that **^^Hero^^**, allocate 1 damage point to a friendly **^^Troggoth^^** unit within that **^^Hero^^**'s combat range after the damage sequence for that **^^Hero^^** has been resolved (ward rolls cannot be made for those damage points).": ""
